OL,3,GNEWSASpecial meeting seeks 'final
OL,4,Adecision' on new primary school plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FA special meeting has been called to
OL,7,Fseek a "final decision" on long-delayed
OL,8,Fplans for a new primary school in the
OL,9,FBorders.
OL,11,FFunding was earmarked for a replacement
OL,12,Fprimary in Eyemouth more than a decade
OL,13,Fago after it was agreed the current
OL,14,Fbuilding was no longer fit for purpose.
OL,16,FHowever, progress has been hampered by
OL,17,Fa range of issues including Covid and
OL,18,Frising costs, prompting Scottish
OL,19,FBorders Council (SBC) to suggest
OL,20,Fcreating a shared campus with the
OL,21,Ftown's high school.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
