OL,3,GNEWSASpecial meeting seeks 'final
OL,4,Adecision' on new primary school plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents have pressed for a replacement
OL,7,Fschool on the site of the current
OL,8,Fprimary and now a special meeting has
OL,9,Fbeen arranged for 17 September to try
OL,10,Fto establish a clear way forward.
